(First, prepare origin_availability_alpha.)
(Step 1: create_candidate origin_availability_alpha)
(Step 2: allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta (choose beta))
(Step 3: attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step 4: confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step 5: assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step 6: lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step 7: release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now destination_availability_alpha:)
(Step 8: create_candidate destination_availability_alpha)
(Step 9: allocate_vehicle_unit destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma)
(Step10: attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step11: confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step12: assign_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step13: lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step14: release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now assemble transport leg:)
(Step15: assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now authorize loading:)
(Step16: authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now mark origin dispatch ready:)
(Step17: mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Step18: mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready destination_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now we need to allocate dispatch slot and vehicle for origin dispatch.)
(But before that, we need to ensure origin_availability_alpha is still allocated vehicle (we allocated vehicle_unit_beta earlier) and not deallocated. The allocate_vehicle_unit action sets vehicle_allocated and candidate_vehicle_linked, and makes vehicle_available false. No action to deallocate except maybe via dispatch? The execute_origin_dispatch effect includes vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit (makes vehicle available). So after dispatch, vehicle becomes available.)
(Thus we need to allocate dispatch slot now.)
(Step19: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step20: execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now after this, origin_availability_alpha dispatched, vehicle_unit_beta available, dispatch_slot_available.)
(Now destination dispatch:)
(Step21: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate destination_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step22: execute_destination_dispatch destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now after this, destination dispatched, vehicle_unit_gamma available, dispatch_slot_available.)
(Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_alpha for clearance etc.)
(We need to create candidate shift_candidate_alpha (it already exists as object but candidate_created false). So:)
(Step23: create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha)
(Step24: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha)
(Step25: attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step26: confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now assign operator, skill certificate, compliance certificate temporarily.)
(Step27: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step28: assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha)
(Step29: assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now load container alpha onto leg:)
(Step30: load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now stage schedule candidate:)
(Step31: stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now verify loading profile nominal:)
(Step32: verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now establish clearance nominal:)
(Step33: establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now release operator and skill certificate (since we no longer need them for shift_candidate_alpha after verification; but we still need compliance certificate for establish clearance, which we just used; after that we can release compliance certificate.))
(Step34: release_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Step35: release_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha)
(Step36: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now attach service window (requires candidate_clearance_established and route_sequence_context_set, which we have after step33). Also need service_window_available (we have both service_window_alpha and beta available). We'll use service_window_alpha.)
(Step37: attach_service_window shift_candidate_alpha service_window_alpha)
(Now validate route sequence:)
(Step38: validate_route_sequence shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha service_window_alpha)
(Now finalize candidate after sequence validation:)
(Step39: finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation shift_candidate_alpha)
(Now shift_candidate_alpha is dispatch_ready.)
(Now allocate dispatch slot and vehicle for shift_candidate_alpha.)
(We have vehicle_unit_alpha allocated to shift_candidate_alpha from step24 (still allocated). Good.)
(Step40: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step41: execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now shift_candidate_alpha dispatched, vehicle_unit_alpha available, dispatch_slot_available.)
(Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta for staged_for_loading, operator linked, skill certificate linked.)
(We have operator and skill certificate available after releasing from shift_candidate_alpha (steps 34-35). Compliance certificate is available after step36.)
(Now we need to create shift_candidate_beta, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm preparedness, assign operator, assign skill certificate, load container beta onto leg, stage.)
(Note: transport leg is still assembled (transport_leg_assembled true) and loading authorized true. Loading container alpha is still loaded and linked; we can load beta as well.)
(Proceed:)
(Step42: create_candidate shift_candidate_beta)
(Step43: allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_beta vehicle_unit_alpha (or any free; we just used alpha for shift_candidate_alpha dispatch, after step41 vehicle_alpha is free. Good.))
(Step44: attach_task_profile shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step45: confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_beta route_task_profile_alpha)
(Step46: assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_beta driver_operator_alpha)
(Step47: assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_beta skill_certificate_alpha)
(Now load container beta onto leg:)
(Step48: load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha)
(Now stage schedule candidate:)
(Step49: stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_beta loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now we have candidate_staged_for_loading shift_candidate_beta true.)
(Now we need to ensure we have not inadvertently set any unwanted predicates that conflict with goal.)
(Goal also requires compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha true. We released it at step36, so it's available.)
(Now we should verify that we haven't accidentally set candidate_finalized for shift_candidate_beta (we didn't). Not required.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set dispatch_allocated or dispatched for shift_candidate_beta (we didn't). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set origin_availability_alpha or destination_availability_alpha not dispatched (they are dispatched). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_prepared for shift_candidate_alpha etc (not relevant).)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set vehicle_allocated for any candidate that we didn't intend; but that's fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set loading_container_available false for both containers (they are false). Not a problem.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set skill_certificate_available false (we assigned to shift_candidate_beta at step47, making it false). Goal does not require skill_certificate_available, so fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set operator_available false (assigned to shift_candidate_beta at step46). Goal does not require operator_available, fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set compliance_certificate_available false (we released at step36, so true). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set transport_leg_available false (it's false after assembly; not needed).)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set destination_leg_loaded or origin_leg_loaded true (they remain false). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_clearance_established for shift_candidate_beta (not needed). Not set.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set route_sequence_context_set for shift_candidate_beta (not needed). Not set.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set dispatch_ready for shift_candidate_beta (not needed). Not set.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_dispatch_slot_linked for shift_candidate_beta (not needed). Not set.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_vehicle_linked for shift_candidate_beta (we allocated vehicle, so candidate_vehicle_linked true). Goal does not require that; it's fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_task_profile_linked for shift_candidate_beta (we attached). Not required but fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_origin_availability_linked or candidate_destination_availability_linked for shift_candidate_beta (they were already true from init). That's fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_transport_leg_linked for shift_candidate_beta (true from init). fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_loading_container_linked for shift_candidate_beta (true from init). fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_operator_linked for shift_candidate_beta (we set at step46). Good.)
(Now candidate_skill_certificate_linked set at step47. Good.)
(Now candidate_staged_for_loading set at step49. Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_loading_verified for shift_candidate_beta (not set). Not required.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set candidate_clearance_established for shift_candidate_beta (not set). Not required.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set route_sequence_validated for shift_candidate_beta (not set). Not required.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set dispatch_ready for shift_candidate_beta (not set). Not required.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set cargo_available false (we loaded cargo onto origin and destination? Actually we never loaded cargo onto origin or destination availability; we only loaded containers onto leg. The cargo payload is separate. We never executed load_origin_payload or load_destination_payload. So cargo_available remains true (initially). Good.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set origin_payload_linked or destination_payload_linked (we didn't). So fine.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set origin_node_occupied or destination_node_occupied (we didn't load payloads onto nodes). So false.)
(Now we need to ensure we haven't inadvertently set origin_availability_confirmed etc (we set them via lock actions)
